    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think there's any way to change how i feel on the inside. everything is just so predetermined. every choice i make is just a way to keep the machine fed. it's like my consciousness is just a layer of grease on the wheels. i'm just waiting for it to finally end so the noise stops.",
